    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28185" root="عجف" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِجَافٌ</span></b>  pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَعْجَفُ</span> [q. v.], (S, O, Msb, K,)
and of its syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَجِفٌ</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also The <i>colocynth:</i> (K:) or the <i>grains of the colocynth.</i> (Ibn-
'Abbád, O, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَبٌّ عِجَافٌ</span> <i>Grain,</i> or
<i>grains, not increasing.</i> (A, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُجَافٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العِجَافُ</span> is one of the names of
<i>Time,</i> or <i>fortune.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, O, K. *)

